# generated bytecode from the bench tooling
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# verify-dd043-pr3.sh run directories: keep RESULTS.md and every log, never the built
# artifacts. The served Maven repo is republished by the script on each run, and the guard
# stage's source backup duplicates what git already holds — committing either would put built
# jars under bench-results/, which tracks none anywhere.
bench-results/verify-*/pages-repo/
bench-results/verify-*/*.orig
